      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Start with a focused pilot."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Choose a repeatable workflow, agree on the evidence that would change our minds, and make the next decision visible to everyone involved."
          }
